OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHeathrow and Gatwick among
OL,4,Aairports hit by air traffic control
OL,5,Aproblems
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt Heathrow, departures were initially
OL,8,Fpaused around lunchtime. Traffic then
OL,9,Fresumed, before facing further
OL,10,Fdisruption in the afternoon. It is
OL,11,Funderstood that very few flights are
OL,12,Fcurrently taking off.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
